        <mxCell id="RFiIRLvbL8tSq_33PrR9-7" value="&lt;h2 data-end=&quot;184&quot; data-start=&quot;161&quot;&gt;Requirements Summary&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;280&quot; data-start=&quot;186&quot;&gt;The system must support a high-traffic product selling website with the following constraints:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;890&quot; data-start=&quot;282&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;386&quot; data-start=&quot;282&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;386&quot; data-start=&quot;284&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;299&quot; data-start=&quot;284&quot;&gt;Concurrency&lt;/strong&gt;: Handle at least &lt;strong data-end=&quot;349&quot; data-start=&quot;317&quot;&gt;N = 6000 concurrent requests&lt;/strong&gt; for viewing and purchasing products.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;515&quot; data-start=&quot;387&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;515&quot; data-start=&quot;389&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;404&quot; data-start=&quot;389&quot;&gt;Consistency&lt;/strong&gt;: Guarantee that the number of successfully purchased items &lt;strong data-end=&quot;497&quot; data-start=&quot;464&quot;&gt;never exceeds available stock&lt;/strong&gt; (no overselling).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;707&quot; data-start=&quot;516&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;544&quot; data-start=&quot;518&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;543&quot; data-start=&quot;518&quot;&gt;Infrastructure limits&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;707&quot; data-start=&quot;547&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;584&quot; data-start=&quot;547&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;584&quot; data-start=&quot;549&quot;&gt;At most &lt;strong data-end=&quot;574&quot; data-start=&quot;557&quot;&gt;S = 6 servers&lt;/strong&gt; in total.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;631&quot; data-start=&quot;587&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;631&quot; data-start=&quot;589&quot;&gt;At most &lt;strong data-end=&quot;630&quot; data-start=&quot;597&quot;&gt;3 relational database servers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;707&quot; data-start=&quot;634&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;707&quot; data-start=&quot;636&quot;&gt;Each database supports a maximum of &lt;strong data-end=&quot;706&quot; data-start=&quot;672&quot;&gt;C = 300 concurrent connections&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;800&quot; data-start=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;800&quot; data-start=&quot;710&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;725&quot; data-start=&quot;710&quot;&gt;Performance&lt;/strong&gt;: Provide &lt;strong data-end=&quot;762&quot; data-start=&quot;735&quot;&gt;real-time user feedback&lt;/strong&gt; with the &lt;strong data-end=&quot;799&quot; data-start=&quot;772&quot;&gt;lowest possible latency&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;890&quot; data-start=&quot;801&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot; data-start=&quot;803&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;818&quot; data-start=&quot;803&quot;&gt;Bonus goals&lt;/strong&gt;: High availability, no single point of failure, and future scalability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="-1160" width="490" height="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="RFiIRLvbL8tSq_33PrR9-8" value="&lt;h2 data-end=&quot;916&quot; data-start=&quot;897&quot;&gt;Solution Summary&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1073&quot; data-start=&quot;918&quot;&gt;The system uses a &lt;strong data-end=&quot;978&quot; data-start=&quot;936&quot;&gt;cache-first, event-driven architecture&lt;/strong&gt; where Redis handles real-time concurrency and the database acts as the final system of record.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1097&quot; data-start=&quot;1075&quot;&gt;Key design choices&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol data-end=&quot;2091&quot; data-start=&quot;1099&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1323&quot; data-start=&quot;1099&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1143&quot; data-start=&quot;1102&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1143&quot; data-start=&quot;1102&quot;&gt;Redis as the real-time decision layer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1323&quot; data-start=&quot;1147&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1236&quot; data-start=&quot;1147&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1236&quot; data-start=&quot;1149&quot;&gt;Product stock is managed using &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1207&quot; data-start=&quot;1180&quot;&gt;atomic Redis operations&lt;/strong&gt; with TTL-based reservations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1323&quot; data-start=&quot;1240&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1323&quot; data-start=&quot;1242&quot;&gt;Stock is reserved &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1278&quot; data-start=&quot;1260&quot;&gt;before payment&lt;/strong&gt;, preventing race conditions and overselling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1603&quot; data-start=&quot;1325&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1360&quot; data-start=&quot;1328&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1360&quot; data-start=&quot;1328&quot;&gt;Asynchronous database writes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1603&quot; data-start=&quot;1364&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1415&quot; data-start=&quot;1364&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1415&quot; data-start=&quot;1366&quot;&gt;User requests never wait for database operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1491&quot; data-start=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1491&quot; data-start=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;Successful payments generate events that are processed asynchronously.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1603&quot; data-start=&quot;1495&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1603&quot; data-start=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;A controlled write path with &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1548&quot; data-start=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;connection pooling&lt;/strong&gt; ensures database connections never exceed &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1602&quot; data-start=&quot;1591&quot;&gt;C = 300&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1780&quot; data-start=&quot;1605&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1647&quot; data-start=&quot;1608&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1647&quot; data-start=&quot;1608&quot;&gt;Database removed from critical path&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1780&quot; data-start=&quot;1651&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1689&quot; data-start=&quot;1651&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1689&quot; data-start=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;Product reads are served from Redis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1780&quot; data-start=&quot;1693&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1780&quot; data-start=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;Database writes are serialized and buffered, protecting the database under high load.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1917&quot; data-start=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1807&quot; data-start=&quot;1785&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1807&quot; data-start=&quot;1785&quot;&gt;Real-time feedback&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1917&quot; data-start=&quot;1811&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1917&quot; data-start=&quot;1811&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1917&quot; data-start=&quot;1813&quot;&gt;Stock changes are pushed to clients via &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1866&quot; data-start=&quot;1853&quot;&gt;WebSocket&lt;/strong&gt;, providing immediate updates with minimal latency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2091&quot; data-start=&quot;1919&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1962&quot; data-start=&quot;1922&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1962&quot; data-start=&quot;1922&quot;&gt;Server constraint compliance (S = 6)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2091&quot; data-start=&quot;1966&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2016&quot; data-start=&quot;1966&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2016&quot; data-start=&quot;1968&quot;&gt;Stateless services are consolidated efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2091&quot; data-start=&quot;2020&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2091&quot; data-start=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;Redis and database master/replica setups fit within the server limit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1320" y="-1080" width="570" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
